--- task
id: t16
dataset: section8
kind: distinct counts

--- intent
How many distinct cities do people live in? Return the number as `cities`.

--- edition2
query distinct_cities() {
  match { $p: Person }
  return { count(distinct $p.city) as cities }
}

--- edition3
query distinct_cities() {
  match { $p: Person }
  return { count(distinct $p.city) as cities }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["cities"]
[4]
